        "TileImage": "$($repository bf60280b-9b3b-4837-a90e-8cbcfe46d515).Image",
        "Description": "47, you have been hired by Robert Knox to eliminate his and Sierra&apos;s problems. You are allowed to pacify people but you are not allowed to kill any non targets as that would be very bad for business. Knox also said he would prefer if  his security system wasn&apos;t destroyed but will accept it as long as there is no record you were ever there. After all it would look worse than Tungun if it was discovered he hired a Hitman. Both Knoxes will act like they don&apos;t know you for their safety. Good luck 47",
